# Modelfile — dataintegrator-qwen (spec §27.3)
# Build with: ollama create dataintegrator-qwen -f Modelfile
#
# num_ctx must FIT IN VRAM. Oversizing silently offloads layers to CPU, which
# roughly halves throughput (observed: 6 tok/s at 16K with 26% on CPU). 8K keeps
# the whole model on the GPU and is ample for this workload's prompts.
FROM qwen3.5:9b
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
# qwen3.5 is a reasoning model: it spends most of its decode budget in a hidden
# <think> channel before emitting the answer, and ignores the /no_think hint in
# this Ollama build. The budget must therefore cover reasoning AND the answer,
# or the visible content comes back EMPTY.
PARAMETER num_predict 3072
